:: Danny Morning Sendoff
<<npc "Danny">>
Danny is heading out with their bag and camera.
<<if $dannyIntro isnot 1>>
  <<set $dannyIntro to 1>>
  They pause. "Oh. Hi. I'm Danny."
  <<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<<else>>
  <<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 15>>
    They slow for a second. "Morning."
  <<else>>
    They nod and keep moving.
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2000>>
  They look hurried.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Comment on the camera|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Let them go|Orphanage]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Sheets Event
You see Danny bundling wet sheets, moving fast.
<<npc "Danny">> freezes.
<<if C.npc.Danny.love lt 20>>
  "It's nothing." They finish quickly and avoid you.
  <<npcincr Danny love -2>>
<<else>>
  Awkward silence. They mutter an excuse.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Offer to help|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny acceptance 3>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave them|Orphanage]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Hallway Bathroom
<<npc "Danny">> is coming out of the bathroom, bag adjusted.
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2500>>
  They look relieved.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Nod|Hallways]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Ask if they're heading to class|Hallways]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>

:: Danny Library Early
Danny is at a back table, camera out.
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 20>>
  They glance up. "Hey."
<<else>>
  Short nod.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Sit nearby|School Library]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Science Seat
You try to sit next to Danny.
<<if random(1, 100) lte 60>>
  The seat is free. You sit. <<npc "Danny">> gives a small nod.
  <<npcincr Danny love 1>>
<<else>>
  The seat is taken.
  <<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 15>>
    Danny mutters, "They were going to sit here."
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Continue|Science Classroom]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Courtyard After
Danny is on the bleachers with their camera.
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 10>>
  They show you a shot.
  <<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2000>>
  They keep the session short.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|School Rear Courtyard]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Cafeteria Edge
Danny sits at the edge, eating quickly.
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2500>>
  They finish fast.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Sit nearby|Canteen]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave|Canteen]]>><</link>>
